## Database Migrations (Alembic)

This service manages the `rag` schema within the shared PostgreSQL database. 
We use Alembic to handle all database migrations.

**To apply existing migrations (e.g., after pulling new changes):**
\`\`\`bash
uv run alembic upgrade head
\`\`\`

**To create a new migration (if you modified models in `entities.py`):**
\`\`\`bash
uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
uv run alembic upgrade head
\`\`\`